# Impeccable installs a 3.5MB vendored skill and a machine-local hooks file.
# Both are reproducible with `npx impeccable install`, so they stay out of the
# repo. Design decisions live in CLAUDE.md and docs/, not in the tool.
.claude/skills/
.claude/settings.local.json

# The campaign book itself. Keep a copy in docs/ to work from — it is the
# source for everything in src/data/equipment.js, injuries.js and
# advancements.js — but it must NEVER be committed. This repository is public,
# and the book's own copyright page permits personal non-commercial copies
# only, explicitly barring distribution. Committing it would be redistributing
# Wyrd's product, which is the fastest way to lose the fan-policy permission
# this whole project stands on (CLAUDE.md §8).
docs/*.pdf
